Alexander "'''Jehar'''" Popa is an [[:Category:American Players|American]] multi-game commentator and Quake player.

Started in the early days playing [[DOOM]], which led him into its mapping community. He later got into [[Quake2]] and the traction from the custom maps that were a major thing then.

Jehar attended his first [[QuakeCon]] in [[2006]], the first of many. Shortly after that he met {{Player|RottenRose|flag=us}}, to whom he later proposed to in the {{Abbr|BYOC|Bring Your Own Computer}} part of [[QuakeCon 2009]] on a [[Quake2]] map he made especially for her. Since [[2010]], he's been casting  the main stage of QuakeCons thereafter.

